# Track source, documentation and selected deliverables by default.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.md
!*.csv
!*.command
!*.sh
!requirements*.txt
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes

# This repository covers problem A only.
/A题/
/B题/
/C题/
/D题/
/E题/
/F题/
/E题研究/
/交接包/
/选题分析/*
!/选题分析/A题附件/
!/选题分析/A题附件/data/*.json
!/选题分析/A题附件/data/config.txt
!/选题分析/A题附件/docs/*.pdf

# Regenerable evaluations and duplicate source/result snapshots.
**/runs/
**/evaluations/
**/source_snapshot/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/.DS_Store
/A题研究/当前最佳方案*/
/A题研究/计算交付*/
/A题研究/实验记录/队友交接构建*/
/A题研究/直接迭代/运行结果/

# Selected official-evaluated plans and aggregate result metadata.
!/A题研究/直接迭代/本轮成果/**/*.json
!/A题研究/直接迭代/第二轮成果/**/*.json
!/A题研究/直接迭代/第三轮成果/**/*.json
!/A题研究/直接迭代/第四轮成果/**/*.json
!/A题研究/直接迭代/第五轮成果/**/*.json
!/A题研究/直接迭代/第六轮成果/**/*.json

# Small saved official observations required by portable mechanism tests.
!/A题研究/方案审阅/cache_microtests/*.json

# Local work products from the documented clone-and-run examples.
/my_runs/

# Selected, independently re-evaluated results from the joint research pass.
!/A题研究/直接迭代/联合推进成果_20260925/**/*.json
!/A题研究/直接迭代/联合推进成果_20260925/**/*.json.gz
